`E_n` = `$δ^{(−)}$`(1/10 log((`$β_q$`-`$β^{(−)}$`)))^2 + `$δ^{(+)}$`(1/10 log((`$β^{(+)}$`-`$β_q$`)))^2
where
`$δ^{(−)}$` ∈ ℝ 
`$δ^{(+)}$` ∈ ℝ
`$β_q$` ∈ ℝ :  barycentric coordinates 
`$β^{(−)}$` ∈ ℝ : the barycentric coordinates of the notch bounds on their corresponding edges
`$β^{(+)}$` ∈ ℝ : the barycentric coordinates of the notch bounds on their corresponding edges
